Bind Npc 24419 Zone 11

On greeting
    If quest 317 is started and player has 910129000
        Say "I am Papud, the third [Undertaker of Suffering]! You have the [Second Certificate of Suffering] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "[Captain] Fargo from Luferson Castle has many duties, including [Monster Annihilation II]. Which of these monsters leads the most powerful horde?"
            Topic "Grave Reaper" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910129000
                    Give 1 of 910130000
            Topic "Great Wafer" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910129000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. Your [Second Certificate of Suffering] has been consumed as penalty. It is time for me to leave now."
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 317 is started
        Say "I am Papud, the third [Undertaker of Suffering]! I only pose questions to those who bring the [Second Certificate of Suffering]."
    Else
        Say ""
